        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Virginia Ruzici, Andy Murray, Guillermo Vilas\n- Events: 1980 Austrian Open (tennis)\n- Places: Romania, Scotland\n- Roles: professional tennis player\n\nFacts:\n- Virginia Ruzici was born on 31 January 1955.\n- Virginia Ruzici is a former professional tennis player from Romania.\n- The 1980 Austrian Open men's singles title was won by first-seeded Guillermo Vilas, who also received $13,000 in first-prize money.\n- The 1980 Austrian Open women's singles event was won by Virginia Ruzici.\n- Andy Murray was born on 15 May 1987.\n- Andy Murray, formally Sir Andrew Barron Murray, is a British professional tennis player from Scotland.\n- Andy Murray was ranked world No. 3 in men's singles at the time of the source sentence.",
